@startuml
title Product Catalog Management - Step 5 - Product Offering test

skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor<<blackbox>> Black
  ParticipantFontColor<<blackbox>> White
}

actor Marketer
participant "EngagementManagement" as EM #purple
participant "ProductCatalogManagement" as PCM <<blackbox>>

box "Testing IT components" #D0D0D0
  participant "ProductOrder\nCapture&Validation" as POCV <<blackbox>>
  participant "ProductOrderDelivery\nOrchestration&Management" as PODOM <<blackbox>>
  participant "ServiceOrder\nManagement" as SOM #blue
end box

note over PCM, POCV : As assumption the tests are done on testing environnement. We run UC 3 & 4. Minimum detail provided on this flow.

group Product testing before validation

    Marketer -> PCM : 110 Launch test process (TMF701)
    EM -> POCV : 111 **TMF701 Process Flow** POST /processFlow\n(OrderCapture)
    note right of POCV : see flow in UC3

    POCV -> PODOM : 112 trigger delivery
    note right of PODOM : see flow in UC4

    Marketer -> PCM : 113 Check test delivery
    EM -> SOM : 114 **TMF641 Service Order Management** GET /serviceOrder/?serviceSpecification=CFSSpec.id96
    SOM --> EM : 115 **TMF641** 200 OK\nService Order representation

    Marketer -> PCM : 116 Look good - test OK

end

@enduml
